## Key Metrics

| Graph | Nodes | Edges | Subgraphs | State Fields |
|-------|-------|-------|-----------|--------------|
| **Coordinator** | 4 | 3 | 2 | 5 (messages, intent, query, goto, error) |
| **Collector** | 6 | 6 | 0 | 9 (conference, year, round, etc.) |
| **Searcher** | 9 | 10+ | 0 | 14 (query, analysis, results, etc.) |

## State Types

```typescript
// CoordinatorState
{
  messages: Annotated<list, add_messages>  // Auto-merged
  intent: "collect" | "search"
  original_query: string
  goto: "collector" | "searcher" | "end"
  error?: string
}

// Command Pattern for Routing
type Command = {
  goto: NodeName
  update: Partial<State>
}
```
